# CME FedWatch published probabilities. Operator populates from:
#   - Manual screenshot of cmegroup.com/markets/interest-rates/cme-fedwatch-tool.html
#   - Wayback Machine snapshots (https://web.archive.org/web/*/cmegroup.com/fedwatch)
#   - Bloomberg / Refinitiv historical (paid)
#   - Investing.com FedWatch mirror (current snapshot only — record daily for new data)
#
# target_lower: lower bound of post-meeting target range, decimal (0.0500 = 5.00%)
# cme_prob: probability CME's tool shows for that bucket [0, 1]
#
# Example: on 2024-09-17 (T-1 to Sep FOMC), CME FedWatch showed:
#   ~37% chance of 50bp cut to 4.75-5.00%
#   ~63% chance of 25bp cut to 5.00-5.25%
